/* Full real-GGUF Shared GU -> SharedDown component. No model/runtime/server init.
 * GOLDEN is an immutable production metallib, CANDIDATE is the separately saved
 * actual deployed candidate metallib. The outer window must bind both actual
 * library SHAs to deployment captures; this probe never promotes a path label
 * to deployment authority. Candidate/helper adoption is a separate full-model gate.
 * CLI: --model GGUF --golden-metallib PATH --candidate-metallib PATH --out-dir NEW
 * --source-identity JSON [--layers 0,13,26,39 --cases 8 --samples 5 --reps 4]
 * --host-only performs argv/path/whole GGUF descriptor/SHA checks without Metal.
 * A1/B/A2 use raw real PSOs, one warmup and >=3 formal samples, one serial CB.
 * Whole output/input/weight guards and bytes are saved. Timings are component-only.
 */
